# The Road to Aht Urhgan (jeuno 91): timePassed's operands one at a time (Timer <= VanadielUniqueDay() and not the
# mustZone), at Prog 2 and Prog 3, set by a GM (the harness clock is day 8000). Prog 2: Timer 8000 with the mustZone
# (Quest[3][91]mustZone 245, as setMustZone leaves it): 10066; Timer 8001, no mustZone: 10066 (both met: #gil's
# 10067). Prog 3 the same: 10072, 10072, 10070 (completed). Accepted, Prog 4 (a GM; set by the 10067 finish just
# before the teleport): no Faursel answer (nil: his default 10065).
lists LowerJeuno/Faursel/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10070
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=39.5,4.1,-45.2 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToAhtUrhgan accepted
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 4
login
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 4: nil; his default 10065
finish
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 3          # a GM
charvar Quest[3][91]Timer 8000      # a GM: today
charvar Quest[3][91]mustZone 245    # a GM: the mustZone
trigger Faursel                     # Timer reached, the mustZone: 10072
finish
charvar Quest[3][91]mustZone 0      # a GM
charvar Quest[3][91]Timer 8001      # a GM: tomorrow
trigger Faursel                     # Timer 8001 > 8000: 10072
finish
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 2          # a GM
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 2, Timer 8001: 10066
finish
charvar Quest[3][91]Timer 8000      # a GM
charvar Quest[3][91]mustZone 245    # a GM
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 2, the mustZone: 10066
finish
charvar Quest[3][91]mustZone 0      # a GM
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 3          # a GM
trigger Faursel                     # Prog 3, Timer 8000, no mustZone: 10070
finish                              # completed; the Boarding Permit
